"""User-facing policies. Operational implementation notes belong in guides."""
CONTACT = 'h82292245@gmail.com'
DATE = '9 November 2026'

POLICIES = {
1: ('Privacy Policy', 'This policy explains how Alphajournal handles information when you use our website, apps, trading journals, research tools, community and affiliate features. It also explains your choices and how to contact us about your data.', [
('Who we are and how to contact us', 'Alphajournal operates the service described in this policy. For support, privacy questions or a grievance, email '+CONTACT+' with the subject Privacy request. Tell us the issue and the outcome you seek. We may need to verify that you control the relevant account before disclosing or changing personal information. This policy takes effect on '+DATE+'.'),
('Information you provide', 'We receive account and profile information such as email, handle, display name, authentication details and account role. When you use a feature, we may process the material you provide, including journal entries, notes, strategies, watchlists, messages, community posts, attachments and AI requests. Support correspondence may include a description of a problem and associated records. Provide only what is needed and remove third-party confidential information before uploading.'),
('Service billing and affiliate information', 'The service uses session, device, browser, network and security information to operate and protect accounts. Billing providers and app stores may provide transaction identifiers, purchase status, invoices and entitlements. Affiliate features can process applications, referral codes, campaign information, commission records and payment or tax details that you submit. Do not send card numbers, passwords or payment credentials to the support mailbox.'),
('How information is used', 'We use information to provide requested features, authenticate you, save and display your work, calculate workspace summaries, administer account access and plans, resolve support requests, prevent misuse and comply with applicable obligations. We process billing and affiliate records for the relevant transaction or programme. Optional measurement, advertising and automatic referral purposes are subject to the separate controls described below. We do not treat installation or continued browsing as agreement to optional tracking.'),
('Visibility and sharing', 'The audience for a record depends on the feature and visibility you choose. Review those settings before publishing or sharing. Public posts, links and shared material can be seen, copied or redistributed by recipients, and removing them from Alphajournal cannot recall independent copies. Private content is used to provide the features you request; it is not made public merely because you install the browser app.'),
('Service providers and external services', 'We use service providers for functions such as hosting, account authentication, data storage and payment administration. The code supports Supabase-backed account and data services and platform-specific billing integrations; actual provider use depends on the service and platform you access. If you invoke an external AI or integration feature, review its disclosure before submitting confidential information. Providers may process information in other countries under their applicable terms and legal safeguards. External websites have their own privacy practices.'),
('Cookies analytics and planned advertising', 'Essential storage supports sign-in, security and requested settings. Optional analytics, advertising, personalised ads and automatic affiliate attribution start off. Google AdSense is planned to support the free version; it is not active in this release. If enabled, ad requests can disclose device, browser, IP, page-context and identifier information to Google. Private journals, messages, notes, balances, credentials and tax or payment details are not advertising targeting inputs. Read the Cookie Policy and Advertising Policy for the scope of each choice.'),
('Keeping information', 'We keep account information and user content for the service while the account is active, subject to your deletion requests and the features available for removing individual records. We may retain limited information for legal, accounting, security, fraud prevention or unresolved disputes where necessary. Retained records are restricted to those purposes. Local cookie preferences expire after 180 days; automatic referral attribution is valid for less than 30 days. Backups and third-party records may have separate removal cycles, and account deletion is not a promise of instantaneous removal from every system.'),
('Your choices and requests', 'Use Privacy settings to review visibility and available export or deletion controls. Use Cookie preferences in Help and policies to withdraw optional choices on this device. For access, correction, erasure, export, information about processing or a grievance, email '+CONTACT+'. Rights, verification, exceptions and response periods depend on the law that applies to your request. If information must be retained, we will explain the relevant reason where legally permitted. Withdrawal does not retrospectively invalidate earlier processing.'),
('Children and account safety', 'Alphajournal is intended for adults aged 18 or older who can enter a binding agreement. Do not create an account for a child or provide a child’s data without first contacting us. Use a unique password, keep verification codes private and sign out on shared devices. No online service can guarantee absolute security. Report suspected account compromise or unintended disclosure promptly through the contact above.'),
('Updates to this policy', 'We may update this policy as the service, providers or applicable requirements change. The current version and its date are available in Help and policies. We will provide notice of material changes and request a new choice where required before processing for a materially different optional purpose. Cookie consent, contract acceptance and device permissions remain separate decisions.'),
]),
2: ('Terms of Service', 'These terms govern access to Alphajournal and its free and paid features. Read them together with the Privacy Policy, applicable purchase terms and any feature-specific agreement.', [
('Eligibility and agreement', 'You must be at least 18 and legally able to enter a binding agreement. Provide accurate account information and use only accounts and information you are authorised to use. If you act for an organisation, you confirm you have authority to do so. Creating an account or continuing to use the service after valid notice of these terms constitutes agreement to them, subject to applicable law. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Purpose of the service', 'Alphajournal provides tools for self-directed journaling, research, analysis and community participation. Features depend on your plan, role, platform and available integrations. The presence of a preview or roadmap item does not promise production availability. Alphajournal is not a bank, custodian or brokerage and does not take custody of your trading funds. It does not provide individual investment, legal or tax advice.'),
('Accounts and access', 'Keep account credentials secure and notify us of suspected misuse. Do not share another person’s credentials, impersonate others or evade restrictions. We may apply proportionate security checks, restrict suspicious activity or suspend access for serious misuse or a legal obligation. Where appropriate and legally permitted, we will explain a restriction and provide a route to question it.'),
('Plans payments and cancellation', 'The offer and checkout identify the actual price, currency, tax treatment, billing period, renewal conditions and included features. Paid access depends on a confirmed purchase or valid entitlement. A locally selected plan is not proof of payment. Store purchases are managed through the relevant store; other purchases through the provider shown on the receipt. Follow the Subscription Cancellation and Refund Policy. Deleting the app or account does not itself cancel a store subscription.'),
('Free access and advertising', 'The free version may carry clearly labelled advertising after deployment. Google AdSense is planned and is not active in this release. A paid plan is ad-free only if its purchase terms expressly say so. Advertising is not a recommendation, verification of a financial product or promise of returns. Optional tracking choices do not change your billing agreement or prevent necessary account access.'),
('Your content', 'You retain rights in content you create. You grant Alphajournal the limited rights needed to store, process, display, transmit and back it up to provide the service and your chosen sharing options. You must have the rights needed to upload or share it. Do not submit unlawful content, confidential third-party material without authority, or credentials. Publicly shared content may be copied by others outside our control.'),
('Acceptable use and external information', 'Follow the Acceptable Use Policy and Community Guidelines. Do not exploit security weaknesses, scrape protected data, manipulate payments or referrals, spam other users or interfere with the service. AI output, calculations, market information and third-party content can be inaccurate, incomplete or delayed. Verify information independently before acting. External services and links may have their own terms.'),
('Installation and changes', 'Browser installation is optional and does not create a purchase, grant device permissions or accept advertising cookies. Browser and device support varies. We may maintain, update or change the service and will give notice when required, including where a change materially affects paid access. No specific uptime, market latency or offline capability is promised unless included in an express service agreement.'),
('Ending use and responsibility', 'You may stop using the service, cancel renewal through the appropriate billing channel and request account deletion. We may suspend or end access for material breach, fraud, security risk or legal duty. Each party remains responsible to the extent required by applicable law. Nothing here excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or removes mandatory consumer rights. You remain responsible for your independent trading and investment decisions.'),
('Questions disputes and updates', 'Contact '+CONTACT+' with service concerns and relevant account or transaction references. We aim to resolve issues through a documented review; you retain any statutory complaint or legal remedies. These terms are intended for an India-first service and are subject to applicable Indian law and mandatory protections in your jurisdiction. We do not require an unconfirmed exclusive court venue or impose a fixed contractual liability cap here. Material changes will be communicated where required.'),
]),
3: ('Cookie and Similar Technologies Policy', 'This policy explains essential and optional browser or device storage, how you control it, and how the planned Google AdSense service relates to those choices.', [
('What these technologies do', 'Cookies are small browser records that may accompany matching web requests. Local storage, IndexedDB, app preferences and cache storage can also hold information on a device. Scripts, pixels and identifiers can transmit information without a conventional cookie. Our optional-purpose choices apply to these technologies as relevant, rather than only to files named cookies. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Essential storage', 'Essential records support sign-in, account security, session continuity and settings you request. The preference record also remembers your cookie decision so you are not asked on every visit. Rejecting optional tracking does not disable necessary account functions. Browser-level blocking of all site storage can nevertheless interfere with sign-in and saving preferences. Clearing storage may sign you out or remove unsynchronised work.'),
('Analytics', 'Optional analytics means measurement of how the service is used when an analytics integration is enabled. The choice starts off and is separate from advertising. A saved permission does not itself activate a provider. Necessary operational security and error handling are distinct from optional marketing or usage measurement. We will disclose material optional integrations before enabling them.'),
('Advertising and personalised ads', 'Google AdSense is planned for the free version and is not active in this release. Advertising permission covers optional ad delivery, measurement and associated storage when enabled. Personalised ads require an additional choice and cannot remain on while advertising is off. Non-personalised advertising can still use identifiers, IP information or storage; it is not automatically exempt from consent. See https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites and https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads for Google information.'),
('Automatic affiliate attribution', 'With the affiliate choice enabled, a referral visit can store a code, campaign and capture time in affiliate_attribution_v1, with a random visitor identifier in affiliate_visitor_v1. Attribution is valid for less than 30 days and is removed when an expired or invalid record is encountered, after conversion cleanup, or when this choice is withdrawn. Campaign click reporting is also gated by this choice. A code you deliberately enter in signup is a separate user-requested action. Rejecting automatic attribution can prevent automatic commission credit.'),
('The local consent record', 'alphajournal_consent_v1 contains the preference schema version, UTC saved time and the analytics, advertising, personalisation and affiliate choices. It is stored through SharedPreferences, normally under a flutter. prefix on web. It contains no ad visitor identifier. Its validity is 180 days from saving; absent, invalid, future-dated, expired or older-schema records leave optional processing off. This period is a product setting, not a claim about a universal legal limit.'),
('Accept reject and change choices', 'The initial notice offers Accept optional, Reject optional and Manage choices. Manage choices provides separate switches and Save choices. Closing or continuing to browse is not acceptance. Reopen Cookie preferences through Help and policies, Privacy settings or available footer links. Save all optional switches off or choose Reject optional to withdraw. Your choices apply to the current browser or device, not automatically to all other devices or accounts.'),
('Save failures and withdrawal', 'If a choice cannot be saved, the interface explains the problem and keeps optional processing off in the current session. You may retry after allowing device storage or continue with essential storage. A failed save is not reported as success. Withdrawal stops future optional activity from connected integrations and removes first-party optional attribution records; it does not recall data already sent or automatically erase historical billing and security records.'),
('Installation preference', 'alphajournal_install_dismissed_v1 stores the time you dismissed the browser installation suggestion. It suppresses automatic suggestions for seven days and may physically remain until overwritten or cleared. It is not an advertising identifier. Browser-managed installed state is separate. Installing or uninstalling the web app does not grant or withdraw cookie permission.'),
('Third parties and regional choices', 'Before advertising is enabled, applicable provider and regional controls must also be satisfied. Google requires a certified consent management platform for covered publisher uses in the EEA, UK and Switzerland. This local preference screen is not a certified CMP and does not generate a TCF consent string. An unknown or missing required permission must not be treated as agreement. Third-party cookies cannot always be removed by our domain; use browser site-data controls and the provider’s privacy controls as needed.'),
('Inventory changes and contact', 'The Storage Vendor and Retention Register describes known first-party records and the planned provider. Active vendor records and durations depend on the deployed integration and must be disclosed when enabled; example vendor cookie names are not presented as observed facts. We will update this policy for material changes and renew choices where required. Contact '+CONTACT+' for questions or requests concerning previously collected information.'),
]),
5: ('Subscription Cancellation and Refund Policy', 'This policy explains how to review purchases, stop renewal and request a billing or refund review. Your actual checkout and payment provider identify the offer you purchased.', [
('Purchase information', 'Before paying, review the plan, total price, currency, taxes, billing period, any trial and renewal conditions. Keep the receipt and transaction reference. Features depend on the entitlement confirmed by the billing provider. A selected plan, browser installation or incomplete checkout is not a confirmed purchase. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Renewals and trials', 'A subscription renews only according to the terms shown when you purchase it. If a trial or introductory offer is available, check when normal billing begins and the cancellation deadline shown by that provider. Do not assume every platform or plan offers the same trial. Review any price-change notice and the available cancellation options.'),
('How to cancel', 'For an Apple or Google store purchase, use that store’s subscription management controls for the purchasing account. For another billing provider, use the management or cancellation route shown on the receipt or in Billing settings. If you cannot locate it, email '+CONTACT+' with the transaction reference. Uninstalling, logging out or submitting account deletion is not a substitute for cancelling renewal.'),
('What cancellation changes', 'Cancellation normally stops the next renewal under the provider’s terms; it does not automatically reverse past charges. Access may continue until the paid period ends unless a refund, chargeback or another entitlement change ends it earlier. Check the provider confirmation for the actual effective date. Download any needed records before losing access to a paid-only export feature.'),
('Requesting a refund review', 'For store purchases, use the store’s refund process where it controls the payment. For other purchases, contact '+CONTACT+' with the account email, date, amount, transaction reference and reason. Do not include full card or bank details. We review the purchase conditions, the issue, provider rules and applicable consumer rights; this policy does not create an unconditional refund promise or remove a statutory entitlement.'),
('Duplicate charges and missing access', 'Report duplicate or incorrect charges and confirmed purchases that did not activate access. Keep the receipt and any error message. Check the purchasing account and use Restore purchases where offered before making another purchase. A support acknowledgement is not a refund settlement; the provider’s transaction status determines whether money was returned.'),
('Processing and disputes', 'Where a refund is approved, processing and the time funds reach you depend on the payment provider and financial institution. Currency conversion or third-party charges may be governed by their terms. If you dispute the outcome, reply with the prior case details and supporting evidence. You retain applicable statutory and payment-provider remedies.'),
('Advertising and account closure', 'A paid plan removes advertising only where its purchase terms say so. Withdrawing optional advertising consent does not cancel a subscription or change billing. Account deletion and subscription cancellation are separate actions, and legally required transaction records may remain after closure. Refer to the Terms and Data Retention Policy for related responsibilities.'),
]),
6: ('Trading and AI Risk Disclaimer', 'Alphajournal supports recording, research and review. Its tools, community content and AI output do not replace independent judgment or qualified professional advice.', [
('No personalised investment advice', 'Content and tools are informational and educational. They do not establish an advisory, brokerage or fiduciary relationship or assess whether a product is suitable for you. Make your own decisions and obtain qualified financial, legal or tax advice when needed. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Risk of loss', 'Trading and investing can lose some or all invested capital. Leveraged products, derivatives, short positions and certain arrangements can expose you to losses beyond an initial deposit or to rapid liquidation. Liquidity, volatility, execution, financing, counterparty and operational risks can change unexpectedly. Do not trade funds you cannot afford to lose.'),
('Historical results and simulations', 'Past performance, backtests, examples, hypothetical returns and journal statistics do not guarantee future results. Results depend on assumptions, fees, slippage, data quality, execution and selection bias. A profitable shared record may be incomplete, unverified or unrepresentative. Check methodology before comparing accounts or strategies.'),
('Market information and calculations', 'Prices and charts may be delayed, incomplete, incorrect or unavailable. Your entries, imports, time zones, instrument definitions, units, exchange rates and fees affect calculated results. Reconcile important figures against authoritative statements. No alert, chart or notification is a guaranteed execution, liquidation or risk-control mechanism.'),
('Artificial intelligence', 'AI can invent facts, misunderstand a prompt, make arithmetic errors and produce convincing but unsuitable output. Verify sources, numbers and assumptions independently. An AI label or confidence score is not regulatory approval or a probability of profit. Review external-provider disclosures before submitting confidential information.'),
('Community sponsors and affiliates', 'Posts reflect their authors’ views. Sponsored content, an AdSense placement or an affiliate relationship is not endorsement or verification of a financial provider. Check authorisation, fees, custody arrangements and withdrawal conditions independently. Never share credentials or transfer funds solely because a message appears in the workspace.'),
('Your responsibilities', 'Protect credentials, verify orders in your actual broker platform and understand the obligations of every instrument you trade. Alphajournal does not hold your trading funds. Any separately available integration is limited by its disclosed permissions; do not assume a journal action places or cancels a broker order. Report misleading content or suspected errors to '+CONTACT+'.'),
]),
7: ('End User License Agreement', 'This agreement grants permission to use Alphajournal software through supported distribution channels. The Terms of Service and your purchase terms also apply.', [
('License and ownership', 'Subject to these terms, Alphajournal grants a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable permission to use the software for its intended functions. We and our licensors retain rights in the software, design and service materials; your own content remains yours as described in the Terms. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Permitted use', 'Use the software on devices and accounts you are authorised to control. Your plan, role and feature permissions determine access. Do not resell or sublicense access, bypass entitlement checks or misrepresent an altered product as an official release. Restrictions apply only to the extent permitted by applicable law.'),
('Restrictions and third-party licenses', 'Do not interfere with security, distribute malicious code or use the service unlawfully. Do not copy, modify or reverse engineer protected software except where a legal right or an applicable open-source license permits it. Third-party components remain subject to their own licenses. External services have separate terms and availability.'),
('Updates and compatibility', 'Updates can change features, supported browsers, security requirements and compatibility. Maintain a supported device and protect important work before updating. Browser installation depends on browser and OS capabilities and does not imply app-store approval. The service does not promise perpetual compatibility or offline operation.'),
('Permissions and storage', 'Grant device access only when using a feature that needs it. Installation does not grant cookie consent, notifications, microphone or file permission. Use browser or OS settings to revoke permissions. Removing the app may leave site storage behind and does not delete a server account or cancel a subscription.'),
('Termination and consumer rights', 'The license ends when your authorised access ends or you materially breach applicable terms, subject to required notice and legal rights. Stop using the software when the license ends. Nothing excludes mandatory consumer protections or liability that cannot be excluded. Contact '+CONTACT+' for license or support questions.'),
]),
8: ('Acceptable Use Policy', 'These rules apply to Alphajournal accounts, content, community interactions, integrations and affiliate activity. They protect users and the operation of the service.', [
('Lawful and authorised use', 'Use the service lawfully and only with information, accounts and systems you are authorised to access. Do not impersonate another person, misrepresent a regulated status or upload material that violates another person’s rights. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Security and service integrity', 'Do not steal credentials, probe other accounts, exploit vulnerabilities, bypass access controls, distribute malware or disrupt the service. Do not evade plan limits, automate abusive traffic or scrape protected content without permission. Report a suspected weakness privately with minimal evidence that avoids other users’ data.'),
('Content and conduct', 'Do not post unlawful, threatening, harassing, hateful, sexually exploitative, deceptive or rights-infringing material. Do not expose someone’s private financial or contact information without authority. Do not manipulate users through fabricated returns, guaranteed-profit promises, phishing or impersonation.'),
('Messages and promotion', 'Do not send spam, unsolicited bulk promotions or repeated unwanted messages. Clearly disclose commercial relationships and affiliate links. Respect recipient choices and community moderation. Do not use the service to coordinate market manipulation or promote unlawful financial activity.'),
('Subscriptions referrals and advertising', 'Do not falsify purchases, create fraudulent accounts, stuff referral identifiers, overwrite attribution or abuse chargebacks. Do not click your own ads, automate impressions, encourage artificial clicks to support the app or reward ordinary ad interaction. Advertising and affiliate revenue programmes have separate rules.'),
('Enforcement and reports', 'We may restrict or remove offending content, limit features, suspend an account or take other proportionate action for misuse, security risk or legal duty. We may preserve evidence where necessary. Where permitted, contact '+CONTACT+' to request review of an action, giving the affected record and your explanation. Mandatory rights and legal reporting obligations remain unaffected.'),
]),
9: ('Community Guidelines and Content Policy', 'These guidelines apply to posts, profiles, comments, messages, shared records and other community participation on Alphajournal.', [
('Respectful participation', 'Discuss ideas without threats, abuse, discriminatory attacks or targeted harassment. Do not expose private information or encourage others to harass a person. Users may disagree on markets and strategies; disagreement does not justify personal abuse. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Honest financial content', 'Do not fabricate trading results, hide material assumptions or present hypothetical records as verified live performance. Do not promise guaranteed returns, impersonate a regulated adviser or use the community to organise manipulation. Explain uncertainty and the basis of a claim. Community content is not personalised investment advice.'),
('Commercial disclosures', 'Disclose sponsorship, commissions, affiliate links and other material financial interests clearly near the relevant content. Do not disguise advertising as an independent recommendation or system alert. An ad or paid placement does not mean Alphajournal approves the promoted product.'),
('Rights and privacy', 'Share only material you own or have permission to publish. Remove account numbers, credentials and unnecessary third-party data from screenshots and attachments. Check visibility before posting. Public content may be copied by other people, and deletion cannot recall those copies.'),
('Spam and harmful activity', 'Do not post scams, phishing links, malware, unsolicited bulk messages, illegal content or repeated promotional material. Do not exploit children or share sexual abuse material. Use report and block controls where available; contact '+CONTACT+' if the relevant tool is unavailable.'),
('Reporting and review', 'Provide the content link or identifier, approximate time and a concise description. Preserve a redacted screenshot if helpful without amplifying private or harmful content. Reports are reviewed in context and may result in removal, reduced access or account restrictions. A report is not a guarantee of immediate removal. We may preserve evidence for security or legal purposes.'),
('Appeals and repeat violations', 'If you believe moderation was mistaken, contact '+CONTACT+' with the affected record, any case reference and your explanation. We may limit details where disclosure could expose another person or compromise an investigation. Repeated or serious abuse can lead to suspension or termination under the Terms, without limiting mandatory rights.'),
]),
10: ('Affiliate Program Agreement', 'These terms apply to approved Alphajournal partners and the referral activities covered by the current programme terms accepted in their workspace.', [
('Joining the programme', 'An application does not itself create an approved partnership. You must provide accurate information, meet eligibility checks and accept the programme terms made available to you. Approval and account access can be limited by jurisdiction or operational requirements. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Independent relationship', 'You act independently and are not an employee, agent, investment adviser or authorised representative of Alphajournal. You cannot bind us, promise product capabilities or offer unapproved commercial terms. You are responsible for your promotional channels, required permissions and applicable obligations.'),
('Referral links and privacy', 'Use your assigned code and authorised campaign links. Automatic tracking depends on the user’s affiliate choice, attribution window, device and supported flow. A user may instead deliberately enter an eligible code during signup. Rejection, expiry, clearing storage or changing devices can prevent attribution. Do not bypass choices through fingerprinting, hidden redirects or cookie stuffing.'),
('Qualifying activity and rates', 'Only transactions that qualify under the accepted programme schedule earn commission. The rate, qualifying revenue, attribution rule, exclusions, hold period and payout conditions shown in that schedule govern the calculation. We do not promise a universal rate or that every click, signup or purchase earns a commission. Keep a copy of the terms you accept.'),
('Honest promotion', 'Clearly disclose that a qualifying referral may earn you commission. Use current approved product claims and brand assets. Do not promise investment returns, misrepresent regulatory approval or advertise planned integrations as live. Follow the Marketing Guidelines and the rules of each channel you use.'),
('Prohibited conduct', 'Self-referral, false accounts, payment fraud, forced redirects, attribution manipulation, spam and misleading offers are prohibited. Do not purchase brand-keyword ads or use our marks in a domain or account identity without authorisation. Do not generate invalid AdSense traffic through the affiliate programme.'),
('Adjustments and payout', 'Refunds, chargebacks, duplicate transactions, invalid referrals and other disqualifying events can reverse or reduce commission under the accepted schedule. Estimated and pending amounts are not guaranteed settled earnings. Payout requires completed eligibility, tax and destination checks and the applicable threshold. See the Commission Payout and Tax Policy.'),
('Review suspension and termination', 'We may review suspicious activity, hold disputed amounts or suspend access for a documented programme, security or legal reason. Where permitted, we will provide a reason and an opportunity to respond. Contact '+CONTACT+' with affected referral or statement references for a review. Ending participation does not erase legitimate accounting, tax or dispute records.'),
('Changes and contact', 'A material rate or programme change must be communicated through the applicable acceptance or notice process. New terms do not convert an unqualified historical event into a promised payment. Contact '+CONTACT+' for programme questions. Mandatory legal rights remain unaffected.'),
]),
11: ('Affiliate Marketing and Brand Guidelines', 'These guidelines help affiliates describe Alphajournal accurately and disclose commercial relationships clearly.', [
('Identify the relationship', 'Place a clear affiliate or sponsored disclosure near the recommendation and link. Tell the audience that you may receive commission for a qualifying referral. Do not rely on a distant profile statement or hidden hashtag to explain a material commercial connection. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Use accurate claims', 'Describe only features, pricing and availability that are currently offered to the relevant audience. Distinguish a preview or planned service from a live capability. Do not make guarantees about returns, execution, market-data latency, uptime, regulatory approval or refunds without an authorised and accurate basis.'),
('Use of brand assets', 'Use authorised names and assets without implying that you are Alphajournal or an official support channel. Do not create confusing domains, account names, app listings or modified logos. Stop using assets when authorisation ends. Request permission before making a material adaptation or a new use of our brand.'),
('Channels and recipient choices', 'Comply with the advertising, privacy and communication rules applicable to each channel and audience. Do not send unsolicited bulk messages, hide redirects or collect credentials. Respect unsubscribes and blocking. Use assigned referral links and authorised campaign parameters without overwriting another partner’s attribution.'),
('Financial and sponsored content', 'Do not turn a software referral into an unqualified investment recommendation. Do not display fabricated trading outcomes or imply that users will recover subscription costs through profits. Explain risks and disclose sponsorship. Google AdSense and affiliate promotion are separate programmes; neither implies Google endorsement of Alphajournal.'),
('Monitoring and corrections', 'Keep the claims and offers in your active campaigns current. Correct inaccurate material promptly when notified. Report impersonation, copied promotions or suspicious attribution to '+CONTACT+' with a link and description. We may require removal of misleading uses of the brand under the programme terms.'),
]),
12: ('Affiliate Commission Payout and Tax Policy', 'This policy explains how to interpret affiliate balances, request payment and resolve payout or tax questions under your accepted programme schedule.', [
('Commission states', 'A tracked event may be pending, qualified, approved, reversed or paid. An estimate is not a settled entitlement. The accepted schedule determines the rate, eligible revenue, exclusions and qualification conditions. Refunds, chargebacks and invalid referrals can adjust an amount. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Statements and evidence', 'Review the relevant transaction or referral reference, gross commission, adjustments, deductions and net amount. Retain statements and payment confirmations for your records. An internal status label is not independent proof that a bank transfer settled. Report discrepancies with the affected references rather than sending full payment credentials.'),
('Payout eligibility', 'Payment may require approval, completed identity and tax information, a supported destination and the threshold or timing specified in your accepted schedule. Provide accurate information through the designated workflow. Do not submit another person’s bank or tax details without authority. Available payment rails can vary by region and account status.'),
('Tax treatment', 'You are responsible for your own tax reporting and professional advice. Alphajournal will apply deductions and issue or make available supporting records where required by the law applicable to the payment and recipient. No universal withholding rate is promised here; rates and treatment can depend on law, thresholds, residency and documentation. An in-app estimate is not a statutory tax certificate.'),
('Requests settlement and failures', 'Follow the payout request and review steps shown in the workspace. A request is not a guarantee of immediate transfer. Bank or provider processing, verification and operational reviews can affect completion. If a transfer fails, provide corrected details through the supported secure route and refer to the original request so the ledger can be reconciled.'),
('Disputes and fraud review', 'Email '+CONTACT+' with the statement or payout reference and a concise explanation. We may hold an affected amount while investigating suspected fraud, duplicate credit, a refund or a legal obligation. Where permitted, we will explain the decision and correction. We do not silently treat every disputed amount as forfeited.'),
('Advertising revenue and termination', 'Google AdSense publisher earnings are separate from affiliate commission unless an accepted programme schedule expressly includes them. Do not combine estimated ad earnings with settled affiliate balances. On termination, qualified amounts and retained records remain subject to the accepted agreement, lawful adjustments and required tax or accounting duties.'),
]),
13: ('Account Deletion and Data Retention Policy', 'This policy explains how to request account closure, review the scope of deletion and understand information that may remain for limited purposes.', [
('Requesting deletion', 'Open Privacy settings and follow the available account-deletion flow. Review the selected account, content categories and confirmation carefully before submitting. If the control is unavailable or you cannot access the account, email '+CONTACT+' with the subject Account deletion request. We may require proportionate identity verification to prevent unauthorised deletion. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Export before deletion', 'Use an available export function and inspect the downloaded result before confirming a destructive action. Request help for records not covered by an export. A request to export is not proof that an archive was generated, delivered or is complete. Preserve receipts and other records you need for your own obligations.'),
('Scope and request status', 'The request screen identifies available content categories and timing choices. A submitted request may require processing and verification; it is not an immediate confirmation that all records have been erased. Check the displayed status and any completion notice. A delayed or grace option applies only when actually offered, and restoration or cancellation is available only if the workflow supports it.'),
('Content and shared copies', 'Deletion can affect profile and workspace content, attachments, community material and other selected categories. Some messages or shared material may have copies held by recipients or independent external sites. We cannot recall screenshots or independent copies. Records needed to handle an abuse report or legal dispute may be retained for that limited purpose.'),
('Records that may remain', 'We may retain limited invoices, transaction or tax records, security events, fraud evidence and dispute information where necessary for an applicable legal obligation or legitimate operational protection. Retained information is restricted to its stated purpose rather than ordinary marketing use. Retention depends on the category, legal obligation and unresolved matter; we will explain relevant exceptions in the request response where permitted.'),
('Backups local storage and providers', 'Removal from active systems and expiry from backups can occur on different cycles. Service providers may also need to process relevant removal requests. Browser or device storage, including unsynchronised drafts, is separate from server records. Clearing it can erase local work and preferences. Third-party domain cookies may require browser or provider controls.'),
('Billing installation and consent', 'Cancel renewals through the relevant store or billing provider; deletion or uninstall does not itself cancel a subscription. Removing the browser app does not delete your server account. Rejecting cookies stops future optional processing under the connected controls and does not erase all historical information. For a separate privacy request, contact '+CONTACT+'.'),
('Issues and follow-up', 'Keep the request reference and any completion message. If data you expected to be removed remains accessible, report the affected record and context without republishing it. We may need to distinguish a retained legal record, a recipient copy, cached display or a processing error. Mandatory privacy and consumer rights remain available.'),
]),
14: ('Security and Incident Communication Policy', 'This policy explains account-safety expectations, responsible reporting and how Alphajournal approaches security-related communication.', [
('Security responsibility', 'We use access controls and service safeguards appropriate to the functions provided and review reported weaknesses. No system is completely secure and no independent certification, uninterrupted service or guaranteed breach prevention is asserted by this policy. Effective date: '+DATE+'.'),
('Protect your account', 'Use a strong unique password, keep verification codes and session information private, and review the account you are using before sharing or exporting records. Use additional authentication controls where available. Sign out on shared devices. Do not store broker secrets, payment credentials or private keys in journals, public posts or support messages.'),
('Permissions and access', 'Only grant permissions needed for the feature you intend to use. Review external integration scopes and revoke access through supported controls when no longer needed. A browser installation is not a request for broad device access. Staff and service access should be limited to authorised operational purposes; contact us if you suspect inappropriate access.'),
('Reporting a vulnerability', 'Email '+CONTACT+' with the subject Security report. Include the affected feature, time, reproduction steps and minimal redacted evidence. Do not access another person’s records, disrupt availability, extract bulk data or publicly disclose exploit details while investigation is pending. This reporting route does not authorise testing against third-party services.'),
('Incident assessment and response', 'We assess reports, investigate relevant evidence and take steps appropriate to the incident, such as restricting access, correcting a defect, revoking credentials or restoring service. We may withhold details that would expose another user or compromise an investigation. Response and notification duties depend on the facts, contracts and applicable law.'),
('Communication with affected users', 'Where notice is required or appropriate, we will explain the known nature of the issue, affected information where determined, actions taken and steps users can take. We will not knowingly present an unverified incident as resolved. No fixed response or notification deadline is promised beyond applicable obligations. Use the contact above for follow-up and reference an existing case where available.'),
('Unsafe ads and impersonation', 'Report suspicious ads, fake support messages and copied sites with a redacted screenshot and destination if safely available. Do not click unsafe ads to investigate them. Alphajournal support does not need your password or one-time code. For unauthorised payments or immediate threats, contact the relevant financial institution or emergency service directly.'),
]),
}


def apply_public_policies(docs):
    for filename, spec in docs:
        number = int(filename[:2])
        if number in POLICIES:
            title, intro, sections = POLICIES[number]
            spec.update(title='Alphajournal '+title, intro=intro, sections=sections, status='Policy', updated='2026-11-09')
    return docs

POLICIES[4] = ('Cookie Consent Notice and Deployment Specification', 'This reference describes the cookie choices provided by Alphajournal and the controls an optional integration must follow.', [
('Initial notice', 'Essential storage supports sign-in, security and your choices. Optional tracking is your decision. Closing the notice does not accept it. Google AdSense is planned for the free version and is not active in this release. Change your choices any time in Help and policies. The available actions are Accept optional, Reject optional, Manage choices and Read cookie policy.'),
('Granular controls', 'The settings view keeps essential storage on and offers independent analytics, advertising and affiliate switches. Personalised ads additionally require advertising; turning advertising off also turns personalisation off. Save choices records the current selection. Accept optional enables all four optional purposes; Reject optional disables them. These choices are separate from service terms, marketing emails and device permissions.'),
('Persistence and renewal', 'A versioned record stores the UTC time and categories in SharedPreferences. It is valid for 180 days. Missing, corrupt, future-dated, expired or different-version records resolve to optional purposes off. Clearing site storage resets this preference. Another browser or device has its own choices. The record contains no advertising visitor ID and is not a contract-acceptance record.'),
('Withdrawal and failures', 'Reopen preferences from Help and policies, Privacy settings or available footer links. Rejection removes first-party automatic referral identifiers. If persistence fails, show a clear error, keep optional activity off and provide retry or essential-only continuation. Do not imply that a failed save succeeded. Withdrawal applies to future optional activity and cannot recall information already transmitted.'),
('Integrations and regional consent', 'An optional SDK must wait for the relevant choice and stop future requests after withdrawal. No AdSense script is active in this release. Before enabling Google advertising, the required publisher configuration and regional consent controls must be in place. The local preference screen is not a Google-certified CMP and does not create an IAB TCF consent string. It must not be used as a substitute where a certified CMP is required.'),
('Accessibility and review', 'Accept and reject actions have comparable prominence. Controls must remain reachable with keyboard navigation, screen readers, mobile widths and enlarged text. Verify fresh visits, reload, granular choices, rejection, withdrawal, expiry, blocked storage and network traffic. Contact '+CONTACT+' to report a control that does not behave as described.'),
])
POLICIES[15] = ('Product Operations and Publication Guide', 'A service reference for maintaining accurate product information, user policies, commercial offers and release records for Alphajournal.', [
('Service identity and contacts', 'Alphajournal is the service name supplied by the operator. The current support, privacy and security contact is '+CONTACT+'. Use clear subjects and provide only the information necessary for the request. The policies are available in the help centre with their current dates; no unverified registered address, certification or named statutory officer is asserted here.'),
('Customer journeys', 'Users can access the help centre, read policies, manage browser choices and view installation instructions without creating an account. Authenticated workspaces offer the features available to their role and plan. Purchase, data export, account deletion and integration status must be based on actual confirmations, not local selections or a successful button press alone.'),
('Commercial accuracy', 'Publish the actual price, tax treatment, renewal cycle, cancellation method, plan limits and advertising treatment at purchase. Affiliate rates and payout rules come from the accepted programme schedule. Do not use one generic withholding rate for every partner or describe a local ledger state as external settlement. Any change to a commercial promise must be reflected in the relevant checkout, agreement and support guidance.'),
('Free version and advertising', 'Google AdSense is the selected provider for planned free-version advertising. It is not connected by this release. Enabling ads requires publisher setup, applicable certified CMP configuration, accurate provider disclosures, permitted placements and entitlement checks. Keep ads out of authentication, private content, billing, deletion and security workflows. Do not pass private trading records or account details as targeting information.'),
('Consent and installation', 'Optional analytics, advertising, personalisation and automatic attribution default off. The cookie choice is versioned and expires after 180 days. Browser installation is optional and independent of consent or payment. Suggestions follow browser eligibility and a seven-day dismissal cooldown. Unsupported browsers receive manual guidance; installation does not guarantee offline work or notifications.'),
('Support and privacy operations', 'Support uses the published contact. A ticket form sends only when a delivery service is connected; opening an email draft is not a sent message. Handle privacy and deletion requests with proportionate verification, a record of the requested scope and an explanation of lawful retention exceptions. Do not publish response deadlines, backup expiry periods or service guarantees that the actual operation cannot support.'),
('Publishing and change management', 'Keep all policy readers and exported documents aligned with the current authored source. Record version, date, material changes and the responsible release owner. Archive prior versions needed for acceptance or dispute evidence. A material new optional processing purpose needs an updated notice and a fresh choice where required. Product guides and technical references are distinguished by their content rather than repeated status labels in the library.'),
('Release verification', 'Test public help links, search, document navigation, mobile text scaling, keyboard access, consent persistence and withdrawal, automatic attribution, install event lifecycle and storage failures. For payments or ads, additionally verify real provider callbacks, entitlements, regional consent and network payloads in a controlled environment. Do not click live ads to test revenue. Review material legal and operational changes with the appropriate qualified advisers.'),
])
